Build against amneziawg-go and the gomobile binder

contrib/awgmobile (copied in by make deps) imports amneziawg-go, and gomobile
needs golang.org/x/mobile. Pinned here rather than resolved with go get so the
AAR is reproducible.

The replace directive for the patched anet is not part of this patch: it holds
an absolute path, so make deps writes it with go mod edit.

